      "connection_topology": {
        "component_connections": "CAN_Interface publishes IF_VehicleData consumed by Navigation_Engine, Media_Player, Display_Manager. Bluetooth_Stack exposes IF_Bluetooth_Audio and IF_MediaPlayback to Media_Player. Media_Player and Display_Manager exchange media metadata via IF_MediaPlayback and IF_Display_Control (logical). Navigation_Engine offers IF_NavigationService consumed by Display_Manager. Voice_Recognition publishes IF_Voice_Command consumed by Navigation_Engine, Media_Player and Display_Manager. Phone control flows via IF_Phone_Control between Voice_Recognition and Bluetooth_Stack.",
        "data_flow_paths": "Vehicle CAN -> CAN_Interface -> IF_VehicleData -> Navigation_Engine/Media_Player/Display_Manager. Media sources -> Media_Player -> IF_MediaPlayback -> Bluetooth_Stack/Display_Manager. User voice -> Voice_Recognition -> IF_Voice_Command -> consumers. Display requests -> Display_Manager <- IF_NavigationService <- Navigation_Engine.",
        "control_flow_paths": "User/voice triggers and UI commands flow to Media_Player/Navigation_Engine via respective interfaces; Navigation_Engine may synchronously call online map services (SERVER-CALL) and return to Display_Manager. Bluetooth control uses asynchronous server calls (connect/dial) with callbacks to higher layers."
      },
      "architecture_rationale": {
        "design_decisions": "采用分层与松耦合设计：硬件抽象层（CAN_Interface）、服务层（Bluetooth_Stack）、应用层（Media_Player, Navigation_Engine, Voice_Recognition, Display_Manager）。使用S/R接口用于高频数据流，C/S接口用于请求/响应服务。将音视频流与控制分离以优化实时性与可靠性。",
        "tradeoff_analysis": "集中式服务（如在Bluetooth_Stack内做更多逻辑）可减少通信开销但降低可替换性；分布式将提高可测试性与可替换性但增加接口与同步复杂度。选择以可替换性与扩展性为主，接受额外接口复杂度。",
        "alternative_considerations": "可将Media playback的解码器作为独立SWC以便热替换；Navigation offline-first策略可减小对在线服务依赖；VoiceRecognition可外包云端增强识别，但需处理网络延迟与隐私。",
        "risk_assessment": "关键风险包括网络（在线导航/语音云）不可用导致功能降级、音视频实时性受缓冲与线程调度影响、CAN丢帧/总线错误影响导航/显示数据一致性。缓解措施：本地缓存与回退策略、超时与重试机制、优先级调度与隔离音视频处理线程。"
